rtesian\ndiagram\n<MATH_0011>\nWith this notation <MATH_0012>.\nSince we assumed <MATH_0013> is a trivial Kan fibration we see that\n<MATH_0014> is a trivial Kan fibration\n(Simplicial, Lemma <REF_0002>).\nThus <MATH_0015> is a trivial Kan fibration\n(Simplicial, Lemma <REF_0003>).\nTherefore <MATH_0016> is homotopy equivalent to <MATH_0017>\n(Simplicial, Lemma <REF_0004>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:de370e3e4d1bcb11e7df8f8ac7a36e210a6fcb42a48074850d3683d9b40c2036", "unit_id": "tag:08PS:proof"}
